1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,640
Do you know the saddest thing in life?

2
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:05,860
It's meeting the right person at the wrong time.

3
00:00:07,540 --> 00:00:09,700
Two people can truly care for each other,

4
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:13,400
but life may keep them apart before they're ready.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,480
And some of the deepest connections become memories,

6
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:21,020
simply because the timing was never right.
